The '''Boss Rush''' is an optional [[room]] that becomes available by beating [[Mom]] in {{s|Depths}}, {{s|Necropolis}}, or {{s|Dank Depths}} within 20 minutes, or {{dlc+|r}} beating her in {{s|Mausoleum}} or {{s|Gehenna}} within 25 minutes.{{dlc-}}

In the center of a large room, there will be 4 ({{dlc|a}} 2 or 4 / {{dlc|a+}} 2, 4 or 8) random [[items]] to choose from, which are picked from the {{ip|Treasure Room|text=Treasure Room item pool}}. Picking up an item will cause the rest of them to disappear and start the Boss Rush. Completing the Boss Rush will also reward 1 more item, separate from the others seen when first entering the room.

== Waves ==
The Boss Rush consists of 15 waves with 2 [[bosses]] per wave. The next wave does not spawn until both bosses from the previous wave have been killed, and any lingering [[monsters]] from previous waves will not prevent the next wave from spawning.

Occasionally, all the bosses fought in the Boss Rush will be their [[Champion]] variants, if they have one.

=== Rebirth ===
All 15 waves are predetermined.
* '''Wave 1''': {{E|Blighted Ovum}} and {{E|Gurdy Jr.}}
* '''Wave 2''': {{E|Carrion Queen}} and {{E|The Wretched}}
* '''Wave 3''': {{E|Peep}} and {{E|The Duke of Flies}}
* '''Wave 4''': {{E|Blastocyst}} and {{E|Loki}}
* '''Wave 5''': {{E|Steven}} and {{E|Gemini}}
* '''Wave 6''': 3x {{E|Larry Jr.}} and {{E|Fistula}}
* '''Wave 7''': {{E|C.H.A.D.}} and {{E|Monstro}}
* '''Wave 8''': {{E|Gurdy}} and {{E|Chub}}
* '''Wave 9''': {{E|Monstro II}} and {{E|Gish}}
* '''Wave 10''': {{E|Widow}} and {{E|Pin}}
* '''Wave 11''': 3x {{E|The Hollow}} and {{E|The Husk}}
* '''Wave 12''': {{E|Mask of Infamy}} and {{E|The Bloat}}
* '''Wave 13''': {{E|Pestilence}} and {{E|Famine}}
* '''Wave 14''': {{E|Death}} and {{E|War}}
* '''Wave 15''': {{E|The Fallen}} and {{E|Headless Horseman}}

