== Trivia ==
* Despite the Timer seen between level transitions appearing, Boss Rush cannot be done the first time the player defeats {{e|Mom}}. Instead, the game will cut directly to the [[Epilogue]].
* {{dlc|r}} ''Armageddon'' is the theme for the Boss Rush added in [[The Binding of Isaac: Repentance]].
* The 20-minute limit for reaching Boss Rush could signify how long it took Isaac to become delirious and start having thoughts about various creations made up in his head, i.e. bosses.

